<title>USA: Polymer says board member Morton Lerner dies.</title>
<headline>Polymer says board member Morton Lerner dies.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLESTON, S.C. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polymer Group Inc said on Tuesday that Morton Lerner, a director, has died.</p>
<p>Lerner joined Polymer as an outside director following the company's initial public offering in the second quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Lerner also served on the board of Federal Realty Investment Trust.</p>
<p>Polymer Group produces non-woven and woven polymer fabric.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
